# Headroom IBM ICA auth-token pool — one ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN per line.
#
# Copy this file to ~/.headroom/ica_tokens.txt and replace the placeholders
# with your real tokens. Order = rotation priority (first usable token wins).
# Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
#
# The real token file MUST NOT be committed — keep it under ~/.headroom/.
#
sk-your-first-token-here
sk-your-second-token-here
sk-your-third-token-here
